              <div id="" class="zn-text "   ><p>Listen, we don’t doubt that your Honda Odyssey is the perfect family vehicle. But if you’re looking for a ride with more horsepower (literally), book a carriage ride at <a href="https://www.nps.gov/blri/planyourvisit/moses-h-cone-memorial-park-mp-294.htm">Moses H. Cone Memorial Park</a> in Blowing Rock, North Carolina (milepost 294). </p><p><br></p><p>During this two-hour experience, gallant steeds will cart you around the 3,500-acre estate of the late Moses H. Cone, an early-1900s textile mogul who built his 23-room summer manor near Blowing Rock, North Carolina. Along the way, you’ll glimpse some of Mr. Cone’s favorite hangout spots, including grassy meadows offering magnificent mountain views. &nbsp;</p></div>
            </div>
            
            
          </div>
        

